# =============================================================================
#
# What this teaches:
#   • line-oriented input mode — `lege lineam` reads a single line from stdin
#
# Common mistakes:
#   • Confusing lineam (reads one line without trailing newline) with nota (writes diagnostic output with newline).
#
# See also: lege
